<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Safeway as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Gary Giblen upgraded Safeway Inc to buy from outperform, his office said.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/2 to 39-1/8.</p>
</text>
